{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have the full brief now. This is a SHOP.CO fashion e-commerce website design task:\n\n**4 frames to build:**\n1. **01_Home** — Hero, brands strip, browse by dress style, new arrivals, top selling, happy customers, newsletter, footer\n2. **02_Category** — Breadcrumb, filters panel, results header, 9 product cards, pagination\n3. **03_Product** — Gallery, summary, options, purchase, tabs, reviews, you might also like\n4. **04_Cart** — Cart items, order summary\n\n**Navigation structure:**\n- Announcement bar, header, newsletter, footer on all 4 frames\n- Header current: Shop on 02 and 03, none on 01 and 04\n- Flow: 01_Home → Shop Now / View All / Casual tile → 02_Category → product card → 03_Product → Add to Cart → 04_Cart. Header cart → 04_Cart from any frame. Product cards on any frame open 03_Product.\n\n**Fixed:**\n- Brand color #000000, Archivo Black and Plus Jakarta Sans fonts\n- Media: photos, social and payment logos, icons\n- Default Button, default Text Field\n\nNow let me read 01 · Foundations to get visual specs.","signature":"a2f502cbd38c40a8a6122cc6"}],"id":"942c4198-d326-4fa8-b92a-b54e5496803a","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7e0442a0-e797-4be3-bd46-d253cafd84e1","uuid":"95dc3135-ed69-49a3-8a20-fec1d693bc5d","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:50:22.239Z","thinking_duration_ms":3521}
