xt Field instance behavior. Let me write carefully with fallbacks.\n\nFor the given Text Field instance inside Newsletter: \n```js\nconst tfComp = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('1:26');\nconst tfi = tfComp.createInstance();\n// children: Label, Input\nconst labelNode = tfi.children.find(c => c.name === 'Label');\nlabelNode.visible = false;\nconst input = tfi.children.find(c => c.name === 'Input');\ninput.fills = [S('#FFFFFF')];\nconst ph = input.children[0]; // 'Placeholder'\nph.characters = 'Enter your email address';\n```\nCharacters change requires font loaded (PJS Regular — loaded ✓).\n\ntf height after label hidden: if hug → 48. Check tfi.height; if 76 (fixed), keep — place in row anyway (row align center? then empty space below input inside field... visible white area below). To avoid, if height stays 76, I'll resize tfi to (400,48)? Auto-layout fixed 76 → resize height to 48 clips input? If layoutMode VERTICAL hug? We'll see: report height and adjust: set tfi.resize(400, 48) then check input position. I'll include diagnostics in return.\n\nButton instance: btn = (1:23).createInstance(); btn.children[0].characters='Subscribe to Newsletter'; btn.resize(250,52).\n\nNewsletter title letterSpacing 3%? Archivo Black 24. Fine at 2%.\n\nHeader nav colors: default all #000000. Current-state handled per instance in frames (S5-S8): set Shop text fill #000000 + textDecoration UNDERLINE? Underline changes baseline look; original: black underline bar under \"Shop\". Text underline with thickness? textDecoration UNDERLINE fine. Others #616161.\n\nAlso header: \"no item current\" (01/04): all black.\n\nWrite S2 now. Also create the \"Header\" component with names for later lookup: cart icon layer name 'btn-cart', nav texts name 'nav-Shop' etc.\n\nAnnouncement bar: absolute close icon: after layout, set closeIcon.layoutPositioning='ABSOLUTE', constraints right/center: constraints={horizontal:'MAX', vertical:'CENTER'}; position x=1440-24-20, y=10.\n\nHmm — layoutPositioning ABSOLUTE inside auto-layout: set after append. ✓\n\nNewsletter component width 1240 fixed: primaryAxisSizingMode AUTO (vertical hug), counterAxis FIXED resize(1240, h).\n\nLet me write the script.","signature":"d52412ff591747e48c62c3a8"}],"id":"137963c1-2eaa-4550-a925-6d672705c1fc","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7e0442a0-e797-4be3-bd46-d253cafd84e1","uuid":"7f2022ec-8a50-4f48-8bee-3bc363d6b783","timestamp":"2026-11-01T22:03:19.105Z","thinking_duration_ms":36959}
