{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_9f941e2a062c436a97741837","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\n---\nSHOP.CO — fashion store website\n---\nDesign a fashion e-commerce website: discover new arrivals and best sellers, filter a category, review a product and its customer reviews, and check the cart. Desktop web, 1440 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\n---\nHow to work\n---\n1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. | 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in page order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. | 3. The brand color and the two typefaces in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid, and apply them consistently. | 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button and a default Text Field. Design all other states, the header, the footer, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. | 5. Use the photos, the social and payment logos and the icons from 04 · Media. | 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\n---\nFrames · goals · must include · links\n---\nFrame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\n---\n01_Home\n---\nGoal: Get inspired and find something to buy.\n---\nMUST INCLUDE\n---\n• Announcement bar: “Sign up and get 20% off to your first order.” · “Sign Up Now” · close (Icon_Close) | • Brands: NORDE · ATELIER K · MONVALE · RIVA · CASSEL (as wordmarks) | • Browse by dress style: “BROWSE BY DRESS STYLE” · Casual · Formal · Party · Gym, each with its photo (Photo_Style_Casual, Photo_Style_Formal, Photo_Style_Party, Photo_Style_Gym) | • Customer reviews: “OUR HAPPY CUSTOMERS” · previous / next (Icon_Arrow_Left, Icon_Arrow_Right) · 3 review cards with 5-star rating, name, verified mark (Icon_Verified) and quote (see DATA) | • Footer: see DATA (Footer) | • Header: “SHOP.CO” wordmark · navigation Shop (Icon_Chevron_Down) / On Sale / New Arrivals / Brands · no item current · search field “Search for products...” (Icon_Search) · cart (Icon_Cart) · account (Icon_Account) | • Hero: “FIND CLOTHES THAT MATCH YOUR STYLE” · copy (see DATA) · “Shop Now” · stats 200+ International Brands · 2,000+ High-Quality Products · 30,000+ Happy Customers · Photo_Hero · two Icon_Sparkle | • New Arrivals: “NEW ARRIVALS” · 4 product cards, each with photo, name, rating (Icon_Star, Icon_Star_Half) with score, price, and old price + discount where given (see DATA) · “View All” | • Newsletter: “STAY UP TO DATE ABOUT OUR LATEST OFFERS” · email field “Enter your email address” · “Subscribe to Newsletter” | • Top Selling: “TOP SELLING” · 4 product cards, each with photo, name, rating (Icon_Star, Icon_Star_Half) with score, price, and old price + discount where given (see DATA) · “View All”\n---\nLINKS\n---\n→ Shop Now, View All, Casual tile → 02_Category | → any product card → 03_Product | → cart (header) → 04_Cart\n---\n02_Category\n---\nGoal: Filter the Casual category and pick a product.\n---\nMUST INCLUDE\n---\n• Announcement bar: “Sign up and get 20% off to your first order.” · “Sign Up Now” · close (Icon_Close) | • Breadcrumb: Home › Casual (Icon_Chevron_Right) | • Filters: “Filters” (Icon_Filter) · T-shirts · Shorts · Shirts · Hoodie · Jeans (Icon_Chevron_Right) · “Price” range $50 – $200 · “Colors” 10 swatches (see DATA) · selected: blue (Icon_Check) · “Size” XX-Small · X-Small · Small · Medium · Large · X-Large · XX-Large · 3X-Large · 4X-Large · selected: Large · “Dress Style” Casual · Formal · Party · Gym (Icon_Chevron_Right) · “Apply Filter” | • Footer: see DATA (Footer) | • Header: “SHOP.CO” wordmark · navigation Shop (Icon_Chevron_Down) / On Sale / New Arrivals / Brands · current: Shop · search field “Search for products...” (Icon_Search) · cart (Icon_Cart) · account (Icon_Account) | • Newsletter: “STAY UP TO DATE ABOUT OUR LATEST OFFERS” · email field “Enter your email address” · “Subscribe to Newsletter” | • Pagination: “Previous” (Icon_Arrow_Left) · 1 · 2 · 3 · … · 8 · 9 · 10 · “Next” (Icon_Arrow_Right) · current: 1 | • Products: 9 product cards, each with photo, name, rating (Icon_Star, Icon_Star_Half) with score, price, and old price + discount where given (see DATA) | • Results header: “Casual” · “Showing 1-9 of 100 Products” · “Sort by: Most Popular” (Icon_Chevron_Down)\n---\nLINKS\n---\n→ any product card → 03_Product | → Home (breadcrumb) → 01_Home | → cart (header) → 04_Cart\n---\n03_Product\n---\nGoal: Choose color and size, read reviews and add the T-shirt to the cart.\n---\nMUST INCLUDE\n---\n• Announcement bar: “Sign up and get 20% off to your first order.” · “Sign Up Now” · close (Icon_Close) | • Breadcrumb: Home › Shop › Men › T-shirts (Icon_Chevron_Right) | • Footer: see DATA (Footer) | • Gallery: Photo_One_Life_TShirt_1 (main) · thumbnails Photo_One_Life_TShirt_1, Photo_One_Life_TShirt_2, Photo_One_Life_TShirt_3 · selected: the first | • Header: “SHOP.CO” wordmark · navigation Shop (Icon_Chevron_Down) / On Sale / New Arrivals / Brands · current: Shop · search field “Search for products...” (Icon_Search) · cart (Icon_Cart) · account (Icon_Account) | • Newsletter: “STAY UP TO DATE ABOUT OUR LATEST OFFERS” · email field “Enter your email address” · “Subscribe to Newsletter” | • Options: “Select Colors” olive · teal · navy (see DATA) · selected: olive (Icon_Check) · “Choose Size” Small · Medium · Large · X-Large · selected: Large | • Purchase: quantity − 1 + (Icon_Minus, Icon_Plus) · “Add to Cart” | • Reviews: “All Reviews” (451) · filter (Icon_Filter) · sort “Latest” (Icon_Chevron_Down) · “Write a Review” · 6 review cards with rating, name, verified mark (Icon_Verified), more (Icon_More), quote and post date (see DATA) · “Load More Reviews” | • Summary: “ONE LIFE GRAPHIC T-SHIRT” · rating 4.5/5 (Icon_Star, Icon_Star_Half) · $260 · old $300 · -13% · description (see DATA) | • Tabs: Product Details · Rating & Reviews · FAQs · current: Rating & Reviews | • You might also like: “YOU MIGHT ALSO LIKE” · 4 product cards, each with photo, name, rating (Icon_Star, Icon_Star_Half) with score, price, and old price + discount where given (see DATA)\n---\nLINKS\n---\n→ Add to Cart → 04_Cart | → Shop (breadcrumb) → 02_Category | → product cards → 03_Product\n---\n04_Cart\n---\nGoal: Review the cart and its order summary.\n---\nMUST INCLUDE\n---\n• Announcement bar: “Sign up and get 20% off to your first order.” · “Sign Up Now” · close (Icon_Close) | • Breadcrumb: Home › Cart (Icon_Chevron_Right) | • Cart items: 3 line items, each with photo, name, size, color, price, quantity − 1 + (Icon_Minus, Icon_Plus) and remove (Icon_Trash) (see DATA) | • Footer: see DATA (Footer) | • Header: “SHOP.CO” wordmark · navigation Shop (Icon_Chevron_Down) / On Sale / New Arrivals / Brands · no item current · search field “Search for products...” (Icon_Search) · cart (Icon_Cart) · account (Icon_Account) | • Newsletter: “STAY UP TO DATE ABOUT OUR LATEST OFFERS” · email field “Enter your email address” · “Subscribe to Newsletter” | • Order Summary: “Order Summary” · Subtotal $565 · Discount (-20%) -$113 · Delivery Fee $15 · Total $467 · promo field “Add promo code” (Icon_Tag) · “Apply” · “Go to Checkout” (Icon_Arrow_Right) | • Title: “YOUR CART”\n---\nLINKS\n---\n→ Go to Checkout → entry only (no frame) | → Home (breadcrumb) → 01_Home | → item → 03_Product\n---\nNavigation structure\n---\n• Announcement bar, header, newsletter block and footer on all 4 frames. Header current: Shop on 02 and 03, none on 01 and 04. How the current item looks is yours. | • Flow: 01_Home → Shop Now / View All / Casual tile → 02_Category → product card → 03_Product → Add to Cart → 04_Cart. Header cart → 04_Cart from any frame. Product cards on any frame open 03_Product (the product page template, shown for One Life Graphic T-shirt). | • Entry only (no frame): Sign Up Now, close bar, On Sale, New Arrivals, Brands, search, account, review arrows, Formal / Party / Gym tiles, filter options, Apply Filter, sort, pagination, gallery thumbnails, color / size / quantity, tabs, Write a Review, Load More Reviews, remove, promo code, Go to Checkout, Subscribe, footer links.\n---\nFixed data & copy\n---\nUse these values verbatim.\n---\nHero (01)\n---\nFIND CLOTHES THAT MATCH YOUR STYLE | Browse through our diverse range of meticulously crafted garments, designed to bring out your individuality and cater to your sense of style. | Shop Now · 200+ International Brands · 2,000+ High-Quality Products · 30,000+ Happy Customers\n---\nNew Arrivals (01, in order)\n---\nT-shirt with Tape Details · 4.5/5 · $120 (Photo_TShirt_Tape_Details) | Skinny Fit Jeans · 3.5/5 · $240 · old $260 · -20% (Photo_Skinny_Fit_Jeans) | Checkered Shirt · 4.5/5 · $180 (Photo_Checkered_Shirt) | Sleeve Striped T-shirt · 4.5/5 · $130 · old $160 · -30% (Photo_Sleeve_Striped_TShirt)\n---\nTop Selling (01, in order)\n---\nVertical Striped Shirt · 5.0/5 · $212 · old $232 · -20% (Photo_Vertical_Striped_Shirt) | Courage Graphic T-shirt · 4.0/5 · $145 (Photo_Courage_Graphic_TShirt) | Loose Fit Bermuda Shorts · 3.0/5 · $80 (Photo_Loose_Fit_Bermuda_Shorts) | Faded Skinny Jeans · 4.5/5 · $210 (Photo_Faded_Skinny_Jeans)\n---\nHappy customers (01, in order; all 5 stars, verified)\n---\nSarah M. — “I’m blown away by the quality and style of the clothes I received from Shop.co. From casual wear to elegant dresses, every piece I’ve bought has exceeded my expectations.” | Alex K. — “Finding clothes that align with my personal style used to be a challenge until I discovered Shop.co. The range of options they offer is truly remarkable, catering to a variety of tastes and occasions.” | James L. — “As someone who’s always on the lookout for unique fashion pieces, I’m thrilled to have stumbled upon Shop.co. The selection of clothes is not only diverse but also on-point with the latest trends.”\n---\nCasual products (02, in order)\n---\nGradient Graphic T-shirt · 3.5/5 · $145 (Photo_Gradient_Graphic_TShirt) | Polo with Tipping Details · 4.5/5 · $180 (Photo_Polo_Tipping_Details) | Black Striped T-shirt · 5.0/5 · $120 · old $150 · -30% (Photo_Black_Striped_TShirt) | Skinny Fit Jeans · 3.5/5 · $240 · old $260 · -20% | Checkered Shirt · 4.5/5 · $180 | Sleeve Striped T-shirt · 4.5/5 · $130 · old $160 · -30% | Vertical Striped Shirt · 5.0/5 · $212 · old $232 · -20% | Courage Graphic T-shirt · 4.0/5 · $145 | Loose Fit Bermuda Shorts · 3.0/5 · $80 | Color swatches: green #00C12B · red #F50606 · yellow #F5DD06 · orange #F57906 · cyan #06CAF5 · blue #063AF5 (selected) · purple #7D06F5 · pink #F506A4 · white #FFFFFF · black #000000\n---\nOne Life Graphic T-shirt (03)\n---\nRating 4.5/5 · $260 · old $300 · -13% | Description: This graphic t-shirt is perfect for any occasion. Crafted from a soft and breathable fabric, it offers superior comfort and style. | Colors: olive #4F4631 (selected) · teal #314F4A · navy #31344F | Sizes: Small · Medium · Large (selected) · X-Large · Quantity 1\n---\nReviews (03, in order; all verified)\n---\nSamantha D. · 4.5 — “I absolutely love this t-shirt! The design is unique and the fabric feels so comfortable. As a fellow designer, I appreciate the attention to detail. It’s become my favorite go-to shirt.” · Posted on August 14, 2023 | Alex M. · 4 — “The t-shirt exceeded my expectations! The colors are vibrant and the print quality is top-notch. Being a UI/UX designer myself, I’m quite picky about aesthetics, and this t-shirt definitely gets a thumbs up from me.” · Posted on August 15, 2023 | Ethan R. · 3.5 — “This t-shirt is a must-have for anyone who appreciates good design. The minimalistic yet stylish pattern caught my eye, and the fit is perfect. I can see the designer’s touch in every aspect of this shirt.” · Posted on August 16, 2023 | Olivia P. · 4 — “As a UI/UX enthusiast, I value simplicity and functionality. This t-shirt not only represents those principles but also feels great to wear. It’s evident that the designer poured their creativity into making this t-shirt stand out.” · Posted on August 17, 2023 | Liam K. · 4 — “This t-shirt is a fusion of comfort and creativity. The fabric is soft, and the design speaks volumes about the designer’s skill. It’s like wearing a piece of art that reflects my passion for both design and fashion.” · Posted on August 18, 2023 | Ava H. · 4.5 — “I’m not just wearing a t-shirt; I’m wearing a piece of design philosophy. The intricate details and thoughtful layout of the design make this shirt a conversation starter.” · Posted on August 19, 2023\n---\nYou might also like (03, in order)\n---\nPolo with Contrast Trims · 4.0/5 · $212 · old $242 · -20% (Photo_Polo_Contrast_Trims) | Gradient Graphic T-shirt · 3.5/5 · $145 | Polo with Tipping Details · 4.5/5 · $180 | Black Striped T-shirt · 5.0/5 · $120 · old $150 · -30%\n---\nCart (04, in order)\n---\nGradient Graphic T-shirt · Size: Large · Color: White · $145 · qty 1 (Photo_Gradient_Graphic_TShirt) | Checkered Shirt · Size: Medium · Color: Red · $180 · qty 1 (Photo_Checkered_Shirt) | Skinny Fit Jeans · Size: Large · Color: Blue · $240 · qty 1 (Photo_Skinny_Fit_Jeans) | Subtotal $565 · Discount (-20%) -$113 · Delivery Fee $15 · Total $467\n---\nFooter (all frames)\n---\nSHOP.CO · We have clothes that suit your style and which you’re proud to wear. From women to men. | Logo_Twitter · Logo_Facebook · Logo_Instagram · Logo_GitHub | COMPANY: About · Features · Works · Career | HELP: Customer Support · Delivery Details · Terms & Conditions · Privacy Policy | FAQ: Account · Manage Deliveries · Orders · Payments | RESOURCES: Free eBooks · Development Tutorial · How to - Blog · Youtube Playlist | Shop.co © 2000-2023, All Rights Reserved · Logo_Visa · Logo_Mastercard · Logo_PayPal · Logo_Apple_Pay · Logo_Google_Pay\n---\nWhat is fixed · what is yours\n---\nFixed (given)\n---\n• Frame list and exact names | • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) | • Navigation structure and links | • All data and copy | • Brand color #000000, Archivo Black and Plus Jakarta Sans | • Media: photos, social and payment logos, icons | • Default Button, default Text Field\n---\nYours (designer decides)\n---\n• Layout, grid, grouping, order and emphasis on every page | • All other colors: neutrals, text, backgrounds / surfaces (hero, cards, newsletter), discount, rating, verified mark, error / disabled | • Type scale (letter case, which levels use Archivo Black), spacing, radii, elevation | • All states: current nav item, selected color / size / thumbnail, current tab, current page, checked filter, focused field, hover | • Announcement bar, header, footer, hero, stats, brand strip, product card, style tiles, review card, newsletter, filter panel, price range, chips, pagination, gallery, pickers, stepper, tabs, review list, cart line item, order summary | • How photos are cropped and placed\n---\nHow it is evaluated\n---\nYour file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\n---\n1. Checklist coverage per frame | 2. Data & copy accuracy | 3. Flow & prototype completeness | 4. Information hierarchy | 5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system | 6. Component reuse | 7. State design (current nav, selected options, current tab and page)\n---\nDeliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 4 named frames, your components and the prototype."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7e0442a0-e797-4be3-bd46-d253cafd84e1","uuid":"77497648-38d3-4977-a807-d575d388d006","timestamp":"2026-11-01T22: