{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark. Assigned file: https://www.figma.com/design/v7DhK3JEKoEZ85CKjv3t3x/ (fileKey `v7DhK3JEKoEZ85CKjv3t3x`). User request (Chinese): 在该 Figma 文件中完成完整设计 —— 先读「00·Start Here」设计任务，参考「01·Foundations」视觉规范，复用「02·Components」组件，使用「04·Media」素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。\n\n   Benchmark rules: account zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai (CONFIRMED via whoami). Preserve all reference pages (00/01/02/04) and their nodes. Build everything in 03 · Workspace (page 6:2, was empty). Use only this file; no account/team switching. Read-only use_figma for inspection, use_figma for building, get_screenshot to verify all screens, fix and re-verify. Load fonts before text edits. Valid Plugin API only; NEVER use `setPluginData`, `loadAllPagesAsync`, `createImageAsync`. Unattended session — resolve choices per brief. Every assistant message with tool calls MUST start with a line \"Reasoning summary: ...\"; after each tool result, same before next call; final response starts \"Reasoning summary:\" then \"Final answer:\" including: assigned file URL, 03·Workspace page ID, screen/frame IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations. Do not claim completion for unfinished work.\n\n   Design task (from brief, re-read in full this session): SHOP.CO fashion store, exactly 4 frames named exactly `01_Home`, `02_Category`, `03_Product`, `04_Cart`, desktop web 1440 wide, light mode, wired as clickable prototype. Brand color #000000 + Archivo Black + Plus Jakarta Sans fixed; all other colors/type scale/spacing/radii/grid are mine to define consistently. Copy/data verbatim from brief. Frames must be named exactly. Evaluation: 1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data & copy accuracy 3. Flow & prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality & consistency 6. Component reuse 7. State design.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (JS ≤50k chars/call; `figma.getNodeByIdAsync` NOT getNodeAsync; omit invalid sessionId on get_metadata)\n   - **CRITICAL: `resize()` on auto-layout frames forces primaryAxisSizingMode AND counterAxisSizingMode to FIXED** — must re-set `primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'` after resize to restore hugging\n   - **CRITICAL: a failed use_figma script is fully ROLLED BACK** — everything created before the error vanishes; verify existence after any error\n   - **CRITICAL: always `await` async helpers before `appendChild`** — passing a Promise throws \"The node with id \\\"undefined\\\" does not exist\"\n   - Height reads immediately after modification can be STALE (e.g. frame reads 200 after full assembly) — children may actually be correct; verify in a fresh follow-up call\n   - Component properties: `comp.addComponentProperty(name,type,defaultValue)` returns key (e.g. 'Photo#11:0'); bind via `node.componentPropertyReferences = { mainComponent: key }` / `{ characters: key }` / `{ visible: key }`; per-instance `inst.setProperties({...})`\n   - Instance text override: `inst.findOne(n => n.name === 'name').characters = ...` (font must be loaded)\n   - Icon tinting: `inst.fills = []` then walk descendant nodes setting fills to target color (skip INSTANCE nodes)\n   - Reactions (planned S9): `node.reactions = [{ trigger: { type: 'CLICK' }, action: { type: 'NODE', destinationId: '<frameId>', navigation: 'NAVIGATE' } }]`; set on COMPONENT nodes so instances inherit; flow starting points: try `frame.prototypeStartNode = true`, verify via `page.flowStartingPoints`\n   - Auto-layout: layoutMode, itemSpacing, primaryAxisSizingMode/counterAxisSizingMode AUTO vs FIXED, layoutGrow=1 spacers, layoutWrap='WRAP' + counterAxisSpacing, layoutPositioning='ABSOLUTE' + constraints {horizontal:'MAX'/'MIN', vertical:'CENTER'/'MAX'}, primaryAxisAlignItems 'SPACE_BETWEEN'/'CENTER'\n   - Fonts: Archivo Black/Regular (style is \"Regular\"), Plus Jakarta Sans Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold, Inter Regular — must loadFontAsync each script before text work\n   - Staging layout on page 6:2: components at negative y (S1 row ≈ y=-5400, S2 ≈ -5400 x2100+, S4 ≈ -5400/-5000 x2900+, x wraps >5600/6800); frames row at y=0: 01_Home (0,0), 02_Category (1640,0), 03_Product (3280,0), 04_Cart (4920,0)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma file v7DhK3JEKoEZ85CKjv3t3x pages**: 0:1 (00·Start Here, brief frame 5:2 — FULL TEXT DUMPED this session), 1:2 (01·Foundations), 1:3 (02·Components), 1:4 (04·Media), 6:2 (03·Workspace — TARGET)\n   - **Design system**: ink #000000, body gray #616161, muted #8C8C8C, surface #F0F0F0, border #E0E0E0, star amber #FFC633, discount red #FF3333 (pill, white text), verified blue #3B82F6. Grid: 1440 frame, 100 side margins → 1240 content. Radii: pills 62, cards/tiles 20, footer top corners 40, hero 40. Type: section headings centered Archivo Black 32; hero title 48/lh58; wordmark Archivo Black 20; PDP title Archivo Black 28; \"Order Summary\"/\"All Reviews\" Archivo Black 20; newsletter title Archivo Black 24; brand strip Archivo Black 28; prices PJS Bold 20 (PDP 28); names PJS SemiBold 16.\n\n   - **Given components**: Button 1:23 (210×52, black, r62, PJS Medium 16 white); Text Field 1:26 (400×76; Label hidden→48; children 'Label','Input'>'Placeholder')\n   - **Media component IDs**: Photos: Hero 4:36, Style_Casual 4:44, Style_Formal 4:45, Style_Gym 4:46, Style_Party 4:47, Black_Striped_TShirt 4:32, Checkered_Shirt 4:33, Courage_Graphic 4:49, Faded_Skinny_Jeans 4:34, Gradient_Graphic 4:35, Loose_Bermuda 4:37, Polo_Contrast_Trims 4:40, Polo_Tipping 4:41, Skinny_Fit_Jeans 4:42, Sleeve_Striped 4:43, TShirt_Tape_Details 4:48, Vertical_Striped 4:51, One_Life_1 4:38, _2 4:39, _3 4:50. Social: Facebook 4:24, GitHub 4:25, Instagram 4:27, Twitter 4:30. Payment: ApplePay 4:22, GooglePay 4:26, Mastercard 4:28, PayPal 4:29, Visa 4:31. Icons: Account 4:5, Arrow_Left 4:4, Arrow_Right 4:6, Cart 4:7, Check 4:8, Chevron_Down 4:9, Chevron_Right 4:10, Close 4:11, Filter 4:12, Minus 4:13, Plus 4:14, More 4:15, Search 4:16, Sparkle 4:17, Star 4:18, Star_Half 4:19, Tag 4:20, Trash 4:21, Verified 4:23.\n\n   - **Created components (all on page 6:2)**:\n     - S1: Star/Full 9:2, Star/Half 9:5, Star/Empty 9:8; Rating/5.0 9:11, Rating/4.5 9:27, Rating/4.0 9:43, Rating/3.5 9:59, Rating/3.0 9:75 (stars-only, H gap4, 18×18 stars); Field/Search 9:91 (350×48 r62 #F0F0F0, \"Search for products...\"); Stepper/Default 9:96 (H gap16 pad20/12 #F0F0F0 r62, Minus 20+\"1\"+Plus 20); Button/Outline 9:102 (white, black stroke, r62, pad28/16, \"Button\"); Button/Checkout 9:104 (352×52 black r62, \"Go to Checkout\"+Arrow_Right white)\n     - S2: **Announcement Bar 10:2** (1440×40 black, text PJS Regular 14 white \"Sign up and get 20% off to your first order.\" + \"Sign Up Now\" Medium 14 underline; Icon_Close 20 white ABSOLUTE right x=1396 y=10, name 'btn-close'); **Header 10:7** (1440×96 fixed, pad 100/24, H gap32 center; wordmark SHOP.CO Archivo 20; nav frame children named 'nav-Shop' (label+'chevron-slot' replaced by ChevronDown 16), 'nav-On Sale', 'nav-New Arrivals', 'nav-Brands' each with child 'label'; spacer layoutGrow; Field/Search 9:91 instance; 'btn-cart' Icon_Cart 24 black; Icon_Account 24); **Newsletter 10:37** (1240 wide, black r20, pad T/B40 gap16, title Archivo 24 white ls2 \"STAY UP TO DATE ABOUT OUR LATEST OFFERS\"; row: Text Field instance label-hidden/white input/placeholder \"Enter your email address\" 400×48 + Button instance \"Subscribe to Newsletter\" 250×52); **Footer 10:46** (1440×373, black, top radius 40, pad 100/64/40, top row: brand col 340 (SHOP.CO Archivo 24, blurb 300w white 60% \"We have clothes that suit your style and which you're proud to wear. From women to men.\", social row Twitter 24×20/Facebook 10×20/Instagram 20/GitHub 20 all tinted white) + 4 link cols gap80 (COMPANY: About/Features/Works/Career; HELP: Customer Support/Delivery Details/Terms & Conditions/Privacy Policy; FAQ: Account/Manage Deliveries/Orders/Payments; RESOURCES: Free eBooks/Development Tutorial/How to - Blog/Youtube Playlist; headers Medium 16 white, links Regular 14 white 60%); bottom: divider 1240×1 white 10%, row: \"Shop.co © 2000-2023, All Rights Reserved\" + 5 payment logos 42×31)\n     - S3: **Product Card 11:2** (295 wide hug, gap12; imagewrap 295×300 #F0F0F0 r20 center > photo 187×280; name; ratingrow: rating instance + score; pricerow: price + oldprice strikethrough + discount pill #FF3333). Property keys: `Photo#11:0` (INSTANCE_SWAP default 4:48), `Rating#11:1` (default 9:27), `Name#11:2`, `Score#11:3`, `Price#11:4`, `OldPrice#11:5`, `Discount#11:6`, `ShowOld#11:7` (bool), `ShowDiscount#11:8` (bool). **Style Tile 11:41** (293×220 r20 clipsContent; photo STRETCH; label ABSOLUTE (24, 180) constraints MIN/MAX; keys `Photo#11:9` default 4:44, `Label#11:10`). **Review Card 11:44** (400w hug pad28/24 gap12 white r20 stroke #E0E0E0; Rating/5.0 instance; namerow: 'name' + Icon_Verified 24 blue; 'quote' 352w PJS Regular 16 #616161 lh24). **Product Review Card 11:77** (612w hug pad T/B24 L/R28 gap12 #F0F0F0 r20; head 556w space-between: left(name+Verified blue)/Icon_More 24; rating instance (key `Rating#11:11` default 9:27); 'quote' 556w 14 #616161 lh22; 'date' 12 #8C8C8C (key `Date#11:12` default \"Posted on August 14, 2023\")). **Cart Line Item 11:106** (792w, H gap20 pad24 #F0F0F0 r20 center; photo 100×100 r12 (key `Photo#11:13` default 4:35); mid V gap4: 'name' SemiBold16/'size' 14 #616161/'color' 14; spacer grow; right V gap8 alignMAX: 'price' Bold 20, stepper instance white bg, trash 20 #FF3333)\n     - S4: **Pagination 13:132** (H gap12: Previous chip (ArrowLeft 20+\"Previous\" Medium 14, white stroke 