{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark. Assigned file: https://www.figma.com/design/v7DhK3JEKoEZ85CKjv3t3x/ (fileKey `v7DhK3JEKoEZ85CKjv3t3x`). Original user request (Chinese): “请在以下Figma文件中完成完整设计：Figma 文件：https://www.figma.com/design/v7DhK3JEKoEZ85CKjv3t3x/ 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01· Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。”\n\n   Benchmark rules: account zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai (CONFIRMED via whoami). Preserve all reference pages (00/01/02/04) and their nodes. Build everything in 03 · Workspace (page 6:2). Use only this file; no account/team switching; do not create a different Figma file. NEVER use `setPluginData`, `loadAllPagesAsync`, `createImageAsync`. Load fonts before text edits. Valid Plugin API only. Unattended session — resolve choices per brief. EVERY assistant message containing tool calls MUST start with a line \"Reasoning summary: ...\"; after each tool result, same before next call; final response starts \"Reasoning summary:\" then \"Final answer:\" including: assigned file URL, 03·Workspace page ID, screen/frame IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations. Do not claim completion for unfinished work. get_screenshot to verify all screens, fix visible problems, re-verify.\n\n   Design task (verified verbatim from brief node 5:2 this session): SHOP.CO fashion store, exactly 4 frames named exactly `01_Home`, `02_Category`, `03_Product`, `04_Cart`, desktop web 1440 wide, light mode, wired as clickable prototype. Fixed: brand color #000000, Archivo Black + Plus Jakarta Sans, all data/copy, media assets, default Button + Text Field. Mine: all other colors, type scale, spacing, radii, grid, layout, states. Evaluation: 1. Checklist coverage 2. Data & copy accuracy 3. Flow & prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality & consistency 6. Component reuse 7. State design.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (JS ≤50k chars; `figma.getNodeByIdAsync`; omit invalid sessionId on get_metadata)\n   - **REACTIONS SCHEMA (this environment)**: `{ trigger: { type: 'ON_CLICK' }, actions: [{ type: 'NODE', destinationId: '<frameId>', navigation: 'NAVIGATE', transition: { type: 'DISSOLVE', duration: 0.3, easing: { type: 'EASE_OUT' } } }] }` — `actions` is a PLURAL ARRAY (not `action`); trigger type is 'ON_CLICK' (not 'CLICK'); transition is REQUIRED\n   - **FLOW STARTING POINTS**: `page.flowStartingPoints = [{ nodeId: '16:2', name: '01_Home' }, ...]` (direct assignment works; `frame.prototypeStartNode` does NOT exist on FRAME nodes)\n   - **CRITICAL: `resize()` forces primaryAxisSizingMode AND counterAxisSizingMode to FIXED** — always re-set `primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'` after resize on hug-intended frames\n   - **CRITICAL: a failed use_figma script is fully ROLLED BACK** — including edits made before the error line\n   - **CRITICAL: hidden instance nodes** (boolean property visible=false) may return **null** from `findOne` inside instances — use null-safe access (`o ? o.characters : null`) or scripts rollback\n   - **Text overflow bug**: text nodes with `textAutoResize='NONE'` and tiny heights (10px) overflow visually over siblings — fix with `textAutoResize = 'HEIGHT'`\n   - Component properties: bind via `node.componentPropertyReferences = { characters: key, visible: key }`; per-instance `inst.setProperties({...})`; instance text override via `inst.findOne(n => n.name === '...').characters = ...` (font must be loaded)\n   - Property-key names include creation order suffixes (e.g. 'OldPrice#11:5') — retrievable via `comp.componentPropertyDefinitions`\n   - Stale height reads right after writes are common — verify in fresh follow-up call\n   - get_screenshot can time out at 120s — just retry\n   - Auto-layout: layoutMode, sizing modes AUTO/FIXED, layoutWrap='WRAP' (counterAxisSizingMode controls height for H-wrap), primaryAxisAlignItems 'SPACE_BETWEEN', layoutPositioning='ABSOLUTE'\n   - Fonts: Archivo Black/Regular, Plus Jakarta Sans Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold, Inter Regular — loadFontAsync each script\n   - Staging: components at negative y on page 6:2; frames row at y=0: 01_Home (0,0), 02_Category (1640,0), 03_Product (3280,0), 04_Cart (4920,0)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma file v7DhK3JEKoEZ85CKjv3t3x pages**: 0:1 (00·Start Here, brief frame 5:2), 1:2 (01·Foundations), 1:3 (02·Components), 1:4 (04·Media), 6:2 (03·Workspace — TARGET)\n   - **Design system**: ink #000000, body gray #616161, muted #8C8C8C, surface #F0F0F0, border #E0E0E0, star amber #FFC633, discount red #FF3333, verified blue #3B82F6. Grid: 1440 frame, 100 side margins → 1240 content. Radii: pills 62, cards 20, footer top 40, hero 40. Type: section headings centered Archivo Black 32; hero title 48/lh58; PDP title Archivo Black 28; prices PJS Bold 20 (PDP 28); names PJS SemiBold 16.\n\n   - **Given components**: Button 1:23 (210×52 black r62 PJS Medium 16 white); Text Field 1:26\n   - **Media IDs**: Photos: Hero 4:36, Style_Casual 4:44, _Formal 4:45, _Gym 4:46, _Party 4:47, Black_Striped 4:32, Checkered 4:33, Courage 4:49, Faded 4:34, Gradient 4:35, Bermuda 4:37, Polo_Contrast 4:40, Polo_Tipping 4:41, Skinny 4:42, Sleeve 4:43, Tape 4:48, Vertical 4:51, One_Life_1 4:38, _2 4:39, _3 4:50. Icons: Account 4:5, Arrow_Left 4:4, Arrow_Right 4:6, Cart 4:7, Check 4:8, Chevron_Down 4:9, Chevron_Right 4:10, Close 4:11, Filter 4:12, Minus 4:13, Plus 4:14, More 4:15, Search 4:16, Sparkle 4:17, Star 4:18, Star_Half 4:19, Tag 4:20, Trash 4:21, Verified 4:23. Social: Facebook 4:24, GitHub 4:25, Instagram 4:27, Twitter 4:30. Payment: ApplePay 4:22, GooglePay 4:26, Mastercard 4:28, PayPal 4:29, Visa 4:31.\n\n   - **Created components (page 6:2)**: Stars 9:2/9:5/9:8; Ratings 9:11 (5.0), 9:27 (4.5), 9:43 (4.0), 9:59 (3.5), 9:75 (3.0); Field/Search 9:91; Stepper 9:96; Button/Outline 9:102; Button/Checkout 9:104; Announcement Bar 10:2; Header 10:7 (children 'nav' > 'nav-Shop' with 'label' + chevron, 'nav-On Sale', 'nav-New Arrivals', 'nav-Brands' each with 'label'; 'btn-cart' Icon_Cart); Newsletter 10:37; Footer 10:46 (blurb now textAutoResize HEIGHT=72); Product Card 11:2 (props Photo#11:0, Rating#11:1, Name#11:2, Score#11:3, Price#11:4, OldPrice#11:5, Discount#11:6, ShowOld#11:7, ShowDiscount#11:8; text nodes: name, score, price, oldprice, '-20%' [discount node named \"-20%\"]; **oldprice binding FIXED this session to `{ characters: 'OldPrice#11:5', visible: 'ShowOld#11:7' }`**); Style Tile 11:41 (Photo#11:9, Label#11:10); Review Card 11:44; Product Review Card 11:77 (Rating#11:11, Date#11:12; nodes name/quote/date); Cart Line Item 11:106 (Photo#11:13; nodes name/size/color/price; children[0]=photo; has component reaction → 16:4); Pagination 13:132; Gallery 14:2; Color Picker 14:12; Size Picker 14:20; Tabs 14:31; Reviews Toolbar 14:43; Order Summary 14:61; Purchase Panel 14:89 (contains 'btn-add-to-cart'); Hero 15:2 (title+copy now textAutoResize HEIGHT, 116/48); Brand Strip 15:26; Filter Panel 15:32 ('chips' wrap now counterAxisSizingMode AUTO h=188, panel 1072)\n\n   - **Frames (all assembled & screenshotted)**: 01_Home 16:2 (h≈3597), 02_Category 16:3 (h≈2238+, now taller after chips fix), 03_Product 16:4 (h≈2891), 04_Cart 16:5 (h=1445)\n\n   - **Reusable helper code (re-declare every script)**:\n```js\nfor (const f of [['Archivo Black','Regular'],['Plus Jakarta Sans','Regular'],['Plus Jakarta Sans','Medium'],['Plus Jakarta Sans','SemiBold'],['Plus Jakarta Sans','Bold'],['Inter','Regular']]) {\n  await figma.loadFontAsync({family: f[0], style: f[1]});\n}\nconst hex = h => ({ r: parseInt(h.slice(1,3),16)/255, g: parseInt(h.slice(3,5),16)/255, b: parseInt(h.slice(5,7),16)/255 });\nconst S = (h, o) => ({ type: 'SOLID', color: hex(h), opacity: o === undefined ? 1 : o });\nasync function inst(id) { return (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id)).createInstance(); }\nasync function icon(id, size, tint) { /* instance, resize, fills=[], walk descendants set fills=[S(tint)] skipping INSTANCE nodes */ }\nfunction txt(str, style, size, h) { const t = figma.createText(); t.fontName = { family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', style }; t.characters = str; t.fontSize = size; t.fills = [S(h)]; return t; }\nconst RATING = { '5.0': '9:11', '4.5': '9:27', '4.0': '9:43', '3.5': '9:59', '3.0': '9:75' };\n```\n   - Header current-state override (02/03):\n```js\nconst nav = hd.children.find(c => c.name === 'nav');\nfor (const it of nav.children) {\n  const label = it.findOne(n => n.name === 'label');\n  if (it.name === 'nav-Shop') { label.fills = [S('#000000')]; label.textDecoration = 'UNDERLINE'; }\n  else { label.fills = [S('#616161')]; }\n}\n```\n\n   - **Brief data verified this session (verbatim correct)**: New Arrivals: T-shirt with Tape Details 4.5 $120; Skinny Fit Jeans 3.5 $240 old $260 -20%; Checkered Shirt 4.5 $180; Sleeve Striped 4.5 $130 old $160 -30%. Top Selling: Vertical Striped 5.0 $212 old $232 -20%; Courage 4.0 $145; Bermuda 3.0 $80; Faded Skinny 4.5 $210. Happy customers: **Sarah M., Alex K. (NOT Alex M. — brief says Alex K.), James L.** all 5-star verified. Casual 9 products: Gradient 3.5 $145; Polo Tipping 4.5 $180; Black Striped 5.0 $120 old $150 -30%; Skinny $240 $260; Checkered $180; Sleeve $130 $160; Vertical $212 $232; Courage $145; Bermuda $80. PDP: 4.5/5, $260 old $300 -13%, colors olive #4F4631(selected)/teal #314F4A/navy #31344F, sizes Small/Medium/Large(selected)/X-Large. Reviews: Samantha D. 4.5 Aug 14; Alex M. 4 Aug 15; Ethan R. 3.5 Aug 16; Olivia P. 4 Aug 17; Liam K. 4 Aug 18; Ava H. 4.5 Aug 19, 2023. Also-like: Polo Contrast 4.0 $212 old $242 -20%; Gradient 3.5 $145; Polo Tipping 4.5 $180; Black Striped 5.0 $120 old $150 -30%. Cart: Gradient/White/Large/$145; Checkered/Red/Medium/$180; Skinny/Blue/Large/$240. Summary: $565/-$113/$15/$467. Filter colors 10 swatches blue selected; sizes XX-Small…4X-Large Large selected.\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **Reactions schema errors (2 attempts)**: (1) `{ trigger:{type:'CLICK'}, action:{type:'NODE',destinationId,navigation} }` → validation error (expected 'ON_CLICK'; NODE variant not matched); (2) adding transition + 'ON_CLICK' with singular `action` → \"Please update the `actions` field instead of the `action` field\". FIXED with plural `actions` array + transition + ON_CLICK.\n   - **prototypeStartNode**: `node.prototypeStartNode` doesn't exist on FRAME → error caught per-frame; stray flowStartingPoints [\"11:2\",\"10:7\"] (components!) existed. FIXED by `page.flowStartingPoints = [{nodeId:'16:2',name:'01_Home'},...]` → verified [\"16:2\",\"16:3\",\"16:4\",\"16:5\"].\n   - **content frames stuck at h=88**: `content.resize(1440,10)` executed AFTER setting primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO' forced FIXED. FIXED by re-setting primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO' on content of 16:3/16:4/16:5 + section-reviews/section-also in 16:4 → 2238/2891/1445.\n   - **Hero title/copy overlap**: both texts had textAutoResize='NONE' h=10 → overflow. FIXED with textAutoResize='HEIGHT' (title→116, copy→48) on component 15:2.\n   - **Style tiles unequal widths** (293/330/275/147): FIXED resize all to 293×220 + row primaryAxisAlignItems='SPACE_BETWEEN'.\n   - **Footer blurb overlapping social icons**: textAutoResize NONE → FIXED to 'HEIGHT' on component 10:46 (→72).\n   - **Filter Panel size chips clipped**: 'chips' wrap container (9 kids) counterAxisSizingMode FIXED h=120 → set 'AUTO' → 188, panel 1072. (First scan found wrong node 'grid' = colors; re-scanned with layoutWrap filter to find 'chips'.)\n   - **\"Alex K.\"→\"Alex M.\" wrong fix**: exact-match replacement returned 0; regex find fixed 1 (changed to Alex M.). Later brief re-read revealed brief says \"Alex K.\" — REVERTED to \"Alex K.\" (fixed:1). Lesson: verify against brief before \"correcting\" data.\n   - **OldPrice not rendering ($260 default shown)**: oldprice node in component 11:2 had componentPropertyReferences `{\"visible\":\"ShowOld#11:7\"}` only — characters binding to 'OldPrice#11:5' missing. First fix attempt crashed (findOne null on hidden nodes in instances → rollback, un-binding the fix); redone null-safe: `old.componentPropertyReferences = { characters: 'OldPrice#11:5', visible: 'ShowOld#11:7' }`. Verified: also-like Polo $242 ✓ Black Striped $150 ✓; home Skinny $260, Sleeve $160, Vertical $232; category same values.\n   - **get_screenshot timeout** on 02_Category (120s) → simple retry succeeded.\n   - Prior-session lessons still in force: failed scripts fully roll back (always re-verify after errors); resize() forces FIXED sizing; getNodeByIdAsync not getNodeAsync; omit sessionId on get_metadata.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Assembled 03_Product fully: announcement bar, header (Shop current), content (breadcrumb Home›Shop›Men›T-shirts, Gallery+Purchase Panel main row gap 48, Tabs, reviews toolbar + 6 review cards in 3 rows of 2 (gap 16) with rating/date props + name/quote overrides, Load More Reviews 218×52, YOU MIGHT ALSO LIKE with 4 cards, Newsletter, Footer).\n   - Assembled 04_Cart fully: announcement, default header, breadcrumb Home›Cart, YOUR CART title, main row gap 32 (3 Cart Line Items with photo/name/size/color/price overrides, photo re-resized 100×100 after swap + Order Summary 416), Newsletter, Footer.\n   - Wired complete prototype: component-level (Product Card 11:2→16:4, Cart Line Item 11:106→16:4, Header btn-cart→16:5) + instance links (Shop Now→02, View All×2→02, Casual tile→02, breadcrumb Home on 02/03/04→01, breadcrumb Shop on 03→02, btn-add-to-cart→04) = 11 links + 4 flow starting points.\n   - Screenshot-verified all 4 frames; fixed her